    rdfs:label "Community Outreach Monitor" ;
    dcterms:description "Monitors outreach engagement rates, unreached population coverage, outreach frequency, and community trust indicators for community service outreach programs. In community services, outreach is the first mile — without it, eligible populations remain unaware of or disconnected from available services. Outreach effectiveness is especially critical for immigrant communities, people experiencing homelessness, and individuals with prior negative government contact who distrust institutional services. Output at [980:984] feeds the Community Access Monitor." ;
